{"version":3,"term":{"cols":80,"rows":24},"timestamp":1788694527,"command":"env NO_COLOR=1 TERM=xterm-256color cargo run --quiet -- --help","title":"ShareCLI CLI help | revision 81c4dfaa208749adfa56ec6bbe07e01b5f80397e","env":{"SHELL":"/bin/zsh"}}
[1.327, "o", "Shared CLI process manager for multi-project agent orchestration\r\n\r\nUsage: sharecli [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>\r\n\r\nCommands:\r\n"]
[0.001, "o", "  session       Inspect durable agent sessions\r\n  surface       Send shell-free I/O requests to a ShareCLI-enabled Ghostty surface\r\n  ps            List managed processes\r\n  start         Start a harness process\r\n  stop          Stop managed processes\r\n  status        Check process health\r\n  proc          List host-detected coding agents (proc scan + RSS/FD samples)\r\n  health        Run a runtime health probe\r\n  config        Configuration management\r\n  project       Project management\r\n  optimize      Optimize resource usage\r\n  prune         Prune idle processes\r\n  pool          Show shared runtime pool status\r\n  run           Run using pooled runtime\r\n  limits        Set project resource limits\r\n  check         Check project resource limits\r\n  thermal       Live thermal-gate / hypervisor state monitor (TUI)\r\n  serve         Start the HTTP + WebSocket dashboard server\r\n  report        Print a fleet analytics snapshot (one-shot or live watch mode)\r\n  fleet         Fleet device management\r\n  mesh          Mail"]
[0.000, "o", "dir mesh task-queue operator surface (status / reclaim)\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "  fuse          FUSE IO intercept operator surface (mount, provenance, CoW)\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "  cast          Cross-machine text injection into registered terminal panes\r\n  proc-compose  process-compose.yaml integration\r\n  completions   Generate shell completion script\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "  man           Generate roff man page for sharecli(1) (clap_mangen)\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "  util          Exercise the bundled utility modules (base85, csv, crc, hash, json, sha, uuid, xml, markdown, trie/skiplist)\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "  list          Enumerate available CLI surfaces (cast modules + utility modules)\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "  version       Undo / restore model (C09 L81.9): inspect or replay the Print the sharecli version\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "  uninstall     Print uninstall guidance and optionally purge local config/state\r\n"]
[0.001, "o", "  undo          Undo / restore model (C09 L81.9): inspect or replay the operations journal recorded at $XDG_STATE_HOME/sharecli/operations.jsonl\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "  help          Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)\r\n\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "Options:\r\n  -v, --verbose\r\n          Enable verbose output\r\n\r\n  -q, --quiet\r\n          Quiet mode\r\n\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "      --theme <NAME>\r\n          Color theme: `backbone-2` / `bb2` / `dark` (default) or `backbone-2-light` / `light`. Maps to Backbone-2 dark/light families in tokens.css\r\n          \r\n          [default: backbone-2]\r\n\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "  -h, --help\r\n          Print help (see a summary with '-h')\r\n\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "  -V, --version\r\n          Print version\r\n\r\nAccessibility (C09): docs/a11y/README.md — NO_COLOR/TERM=dumb degrade ANSI color; FR-004 status via `sharecli status` and GET /health. Degraded-mode notes: docs/a11y/status-and-recovery.md\r\nHelp & FAQ (C09 L81.13): docs/faq.md — top troubleshooting answers; `man sharecli` after `just man`.\r\n"]
[0.001, "x", "0"]
